    4. Mark trail cells between source and endpoint (exclusive of both); verify no trail cell collides with another trail or source
    5. Mirror each source position across separator to get top marker positions
    6. Fill grid: bg everywhere, separator row with sep_color, source pixels, trail pixels, top markers
    7. Reject if any constraint violated (collisions, out-of-bounds); retry from step 2
